
/usr/share/rpcd/ucode/tailscale.uc(上游 Tokisaki-Galaxy/luci-app-tailscale-community)的补丁.
应用: 3.feeds-after-script.sh 的 # luci-app-tailscale-community 段, patch -p1 -F0 在包目录下应用, 上下文与上游不匹配时构建失败.
作用: setup_firewall 写不了状态文件时, 返回的 error 改为说明配置已提交但未应用.
原因: 这个出口在 UCI 提交之后, 配置已写入 /etc/config, 后台重载脚本没有启动, network 和 firewall 没有重载. 上游的消息是 "Configuration was not changed.", 与实际相反. 再次执行时配置已齐全, setup_firewall 直接返回, 不会补做重载.

--- a/root/usr/share/rpcd/ucode/tailscale.uc
+++ b/root/usr/share/rpcd/ucode/tailscale.uc
@@ -367,7 +367,7 @@
 				if (st == null || rename('/var/run/tailscale-fwsetup.status.tmp', '/var/run/tailscale-fwsetup.status') == null) {
 					// Without a writable status file the poll can never see a
 					// result, so say so instead of letting the UI wait it out.
-					return { error: 'Cannot write the firewall status file in /var/run. Configuration was not changed.' };
+					return { error: 'Cannot write the firewall status file in /var/run. The configuration was committed but not applied.' };
 				}
 
 				// The background shell exits immediately, so its status only
